+msgstr "math:Number 上的义务同时涉及数系类型和值的数量。允许的目标包括通常的命名数系个体和 math:ExtendedRealLine。所选数系能否描述该数，取决于数学语境。"
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/UnsituatedNumber|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
+msgid "A math:RationalNumber marked math:isExact true with no math:inNumberSystem link illustrates a missing-system case. A valid declaration for the exact number one third links to math:rationalNumbers."
+msgstr "一个标记为 math:isExact true 却缺少 math:inNumberSystem 链接的 math:RationalNumber 展示了缺少数系的情形。精确数三分之一的有效声明指向 math:rationalNumbers。"
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/UnsituatedNumber|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
+msgid "Use to interpret a finding attributed to the math:inNumberSystem requirement on math:Number."
+msgstr "用于解释归入 math:Number 上的 math:inNumberSystem 要求的验证发现。"
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/UnsituatedNumber|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
+msgid "Use the reported component to investigate whether a system link is missing. Assess exactness and mathematical membership independently."
+msgstr "根据报告的组件查看数系链接是否缺失。另行判断精确性和数学上的归属关系。"
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/UnsituatedNumber|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
+msgid "Read the focus node, component, path, value and source shape for the reported problem. Repair the declaration so math:inNumberSystem points to one justified math:NumberSystem individual. Express containment between systems through math:subsystemOf."
+msgstr "查看问题所涉及的焦点节点、组件、路径、值和来源形状。修正声明，使 math:inNumberSystem 指向一个有充分依据的 math:NumberSystem 个体。通过 math:subsystemOf 表达数系之间的包含关系。"
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/math/tests/ecNumberSituated|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conformanceRationale"
+msgid "The control declares a math:RationalNumber with math:isExact true and exactly one math:inNumberSystem value, math:rationalNumbers. The cell expects a conforming result from the generated validation surface."
+msgstr "对照样例声明了一个标记为 math:isExact true 的 math:RationalNumber，并为其声明了恰好一个 math:inNumberSystem 值，即 math:rationalNumbers。该单元预期生成的验证视图给出符合规范的结果。"
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/math/tests/ecNumberMissingSystem|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conformanceRationale"
+msgid "The counter-example declares exactness but omits math:inNumberSystem. Class isolation requires at least one math:UnsituatedNumber finding and rejects findings outside that class in the selected channels."
+msgstr "反例声明了精确性，却省略了 math:inNumberSystem。类隔离检查要求至少有一项 math:UnsituatedNumber 发现，并拒绝所选渠道中归入其他类的发现。"
